---
id: PersetujuanDokumen-TolakDokumen
title: Persetujuan Dokumen - Tolak Dokumen
---
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"background": "#dddddd", "primaryColor": "#ffffff", "primaryBorderColor": "#000000", "primaryTextColor": "#000000", "lineColor": "#000000", "textColor": "#000000", "actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#000000", "actorTextColor": "#000000", "activationBkgColor": "#ffffff", "activationBorderColor": "#000000", "signalColor": "#000000", "signalTextColor": "#000000", "labelBoxBkgColor": "#ffffff", "labelBoxBorderColor": "#000000", "labelTextColor": "#000000", "sequenceNumberColor": "#000000", "noteBkgColor": "#ffffff", "noteBorderColor": "#000000", "noteTextColor": "#000000"}, "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true, "wrap": true, "messageFontSize": 12, "noteFontSize": 12}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HR as HR/Super Admin
    participant UI as Web UI :boundary
    participant C as DocumentApprovalController :control
    participant D as WorkerDocument Model :entity
    participant DB as Database :entity

    HR->>+UI: Klik tombol "Tolak" pada dokumen
    UI->>+UI: Tampilkan form penolakan (alasan penolakan)
    HR->>+UI: Isi alasan penolakan dan klik Tolak
    UI->>+C: POST /admin/document-approvals/{id}/reject
    C->>+D: Update status = rejected, rejected_by = HR_id, rejected_at = now, rejection_reason
    D->>+DB: UPDATE worker_documents SET status = 'rejected', rejected_by = ?, rejected_at = NOW(), rejection_reason = ? WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>-D: Dokumen berhasil ditolak
    D-->>-C: Updated WorkerDocument
    C-->>-UI: Response sukses
    UI-->>-HR: Notifikasi penolakan berhasil
    note over C: Notifikasi ke pegawai: dokumen ditolak dengan alasan, minta upload ulang

